# Optional: endpoint to notify you when someone downloads a guide (e.g. Formspree).
# Create a form at https://formspree.io and set your form URL here (e.g. https://formspree.io/f/xxxxx).
# You will receive an email with: email, guideTitle, message.
VITE_DOWNLOAD_NOTIFY_ENDPOINT=

# Optional: endpoint to save free-book signups (name + email) for future leads (e.g. Formspree).
# The app POSTs: name, email, fromEmail, pdfPath, bookTitle. Where to check: Formspree dashboard
# (Submissions), your database, or whatever service you use.
VITE_LEAD_MAGNET_ENDPOINT=
